# smoke.vrs: proves vrclient can join the dev server, run .nyar commands as admin and read the replies.
# Needs: the dev server running with Nyarlathotep and DevChatEcho; Chaos in adminlist.txt.
ensure
console TPHome
wait 3
mark
chat .nyar api version
expect-reply [NYAR:
chat .nyar status
expect-reply tracked units
shot full smoke-status
